HOMM2_MESSAGE("adventure.arena.choose_skill", "You enter the arena and face a pack of vicious lions.  You handily defeat them, to the wild cheers of the crowd.  Impressed by your skill, the aged trainer of gladiators agrees to train you in a skill of your choice.")
