HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.021d355fcf4f31af", "{Flotsam}\n\nYou search through the flotsam, and find some wood.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.0ec7b47d176de1a3", "{Magic Well}\n\nA drink from the well has restored your spell points to maximum.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.114341b70ac61964", "{Artifact}\n\nYou've found the humble dwelling of a withered hermit.  The hermit tells you that he is willing to give the %s to the first wise person he meets.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.12821ba5d6cffff7", "{Shipwreck Survivor}\n\nYou've pulled a shipwreck survivor from certain death in an unforgiving ocean.  Grateful, he says, \"I would give you an artifact as a reward, but you're all full.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.14d0296e539d777e", "{Magic Garden}\n\nYou've found a magic garden, the kind of place that leprechauns and faeries like to cavort in, but there is no one here today.  Perhaps you should try again next week.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.1553297e35c659a6", "{Sphinx}\n\nYou come across a giant Sphinx.  The Sphinx remains strangely quiet.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.16a4b831c7bd6a44", "{Freeman's Foundry}\n\nAll of your  %s, %s and %s have been upgraded into %s, %s, and %s.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.1836ce3164cbf13b", "{Ruins}\n\nYou've found some Medusas living in the ruins.  They are willing to join your army for a price.  Do you want to recruit Medusas?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.19dbe84af3193778", "{Magellan's Maps}\n\nA retired captain living on this refurbished fishing platform offers to sell you maps of the sea he made in his younger days for 1,000 gold.  Do you wish to buy the maps?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.1a911306b482a58b", "You come upon an abandoned gold mine.  The mine appears to be haunted.  Do you wish to enter?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.1b32f445f3853c55", "The Demon leaps upon you and has its claws at your throat before you can even draw your sword.  \"Your life is mine,\" it says.  \"I will sell it back to you for 2,500 gold.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.1c9a29276fc4ba9c", "As you enter the Alchemist's Tower, a hobbled, graying man in a brown cloak makes his way towards you.  He checks your pack, and sees that you have %d cursed items.  For 750 gold,  the alchemist will remove them for you.  Do you pay?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.1ee518efd93cbc65", "As you speak the magic word, the glowing barrier dissolves into nothingness.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.1fe5ee69b3203322", "{Derelict Ship}\n\nThe rotting hulk of a great pirate ship creaks eerily as it is pushed against the rocks.  Do you wish to search the ship?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.20d6ea6df7166f59", "{Dragon City}\n\nThe Dragon city has no Dragons willing to join you this week.  Perhaps a Dragon will become available next week.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.21050646fbb7b09b", "{Standing Stones}\n\nYou've found a group of Druids worshipping at one of their strange stone edifices.  Silently, they teach you new ways to cast spells.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.219ab198b8338466", "{Artifact}\n\nA leprechaun offers you the %s for the small price of 2000 gold.  Do you wish to buy this artifact?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.229894cb0c595023", "{Temple}\n\nA visit and a prayer at the temple raises the morale of your troops.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.280d4b94ba469861", "{City of the Dead}\n\nSome Liches living here are willing to join your army for a price.  Do you want to recruit Liches?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.29ceb4fc2c520780", "Discretion is the better part of valor, and you decide to avoid this fight for today.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.2b436715930a57ee", "Error receiving data.  Keep trying?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.2ba84ac8f84d579f", "{Fort}\n\n The soldiers living in the fort teach you a few new defensive tricks.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.2c0fc1c524da5be1", "The Demon screams its challenge and attacks!  After a short, desperate battle, you slay the monster and receive 1,000 experience points.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.2f685e157f228f6f", "%d of the %d %s will join your army, and the rest will leave you alone, for the sum of %d gold.  Do you accept?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.30d6f33566016021", "You already have 8 heroes, and regretfully must leave the prisoner in this jail to languish in agony for untold days.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.333bff0ee2591ce7", "{Chest}\n\nAfter spending hours trying to fish the chest out of the sea, you open it and find 1500 gold pieces.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.33c78d108003798f", "Seeing that you do not have 2500 gold, the demon slashes you with its claws, and the last thing you see is a red haze.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.35891c3b946b11c8", "You hear a voice from behind the locked door, \"You don't have enough gold to pay for my services.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.36d8db3120534c34", "{Hill Fort}\n\n All of the %s, %s and %s you have in your army have been trained by the battle masters of the fort.  Your army now contains %s, %s, and %s.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.37291a931defe30b", "{Idol}\n\nYou've found an ancient and weathered stone idol.  It is supposed to grant luck to visitors, but since the stars are already smiling upon you, it does nothing.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.3c1ac9096798469d", "Upon defeating the monsters, you decipher an ancient glyph on the wall, telling the secret of the spell - ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.412b3e9f25bdd6fb", "{Mercenary Camp}\n\nYou've come upon a mercenary camp practicing their tactics.  The mercenaries welcome you and your troops and invite you to train with them.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.414c8dd999ff1206", "You come upon the pyramid of a great and ancient king.  Routine exploration reveals that the pyramid is completely empty.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.41d63febc86c9f57", "{Fort}\n\n \"I'm sorry sir,\" The leader of the soldiers says, \"but you already know everything we have to teach.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.459e418255ebdf2c", "The creatures are swayed by your diplomatic tongue, and make you an offer:\n\n")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.47fbd3f75db6688a", "{Artifact}\n\nYou come upon an ancient artifact.  As you reach for it, a pack of Rogues leap out of the brush to guard their stolen loot.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.4967a4ae1966d928", "{Shipwreck Survivor}\n\nYou've pulled a shipwreck survivor from certain death in an unforgiving ocean.  Grateful, he rewards you for your act of kindness by giving you the %s.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.49edf5c404ac2672", "{Freeman's Foundry}\n\nAll of your %s and %s have been upgraded into %s and %s.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.4a92b05b80d8fdb1", "{Oasis}\n\nA drink at the oasis fills your troops with strength and lifts their spirits.  You can travel a bit further today.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.4a9a02fcd852e2b3", "As you approach the group of elves, their leader calls them all to attention.  He shouts to them, \"Who of you is brave enough to join this fearless ally of ours?\"  The group explodes with cheers as they run to join your ranks.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.4be252d59fc6debb", "You hear a voice from high above in the tower, \"Go away! I can't help you!\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.4e929a833e525afd", "The fabled golden bow of the elves lies here in the dust.  You take it and journey back to the elven towns.  They shower you with their graciousness and the king promises that his people will aid you whenever you seek help.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.4f16d62af9eceb3d", "{Witch's Hut}\n\nAn ancient and immortal witch living in a hut with bird's legs for stilts teaches you %s for her own inscrutable purposes.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.51b8add2648e9e2f", "{Tree of Knowledge}\n\nUpon your approach, the tree opens its eyes in delight.  \"Ahh, an adventurer!  Allow me to teach you a little of what I have learned over the ages.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.53220bf577626eb3", "\"The Dwarfbane!!!!, run for your lives.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.536b0d04d7ca290d", "You enter the tent and see an old woman gazing into a magic gem.  She looks up and says, \"In my travels, I have learned much in the way of arcane magic.  A great oracle taught me his skill.  I have the answer you seek.  The %s keyword is '%s'.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.57f459c519bb0e07", "{Shrine of the 1st Circle}\n\nYou come across a small shrine attended by a group of novice acolytes.  In exchange for your protection, they agree to teach you a simple spell - ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.580a8ff25d58cea2", "{Artifact}\n\nThrough a clearing you observe an ancient artifact.  Unfortunately, it's guarded by a nearby %s.  Do you want to fight the %s for the artifact?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.59f3f5aaa52a791b", "{City of the Dead}\n\nThe City of the Dead is empty of life, and empty of unlife as well.  Perhaps some undead will move in next week.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.5aa1a1227a3f148e", "In a dazzling display of daring, you break into the local jail and free the hero imprisoned there, who, in return, pledges loyalty to your cause.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.5ad75e9e7fadd1a6", "{Chest}\n\nAfter scouring the area, you fall upon a hidden chest, containing the ancient artifact '%s'")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.5ae328bcb860b385", "{Dragon City}\n\nHaving defeated the Dragon champions, the city's leaders agree to supply some Dragons to your army for a price.  Do you wish to recruit Dragons?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.5bee846fe950642e", "{Oasis}\n\nThe drink at the oasis is refreshing, but offers no further benefit.  The oasis might help again if you fought a battle first.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.5e4d96b705906aad", "The Arena guards turn you away.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.61cb3563007fe53a", "The %s is swayed by your diplomatic tongue, and offers to join your army for the sum of %d gold.  Do you accept?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.640141be28ff3fd6", "{Wagon}\n\nYou come across an old wagon left by a trader who didn't quite make it to safe terrain.  Unfortunately, others have found it first, and the wagon is empty.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.6674f02fddf78450", "{Troll Bridge}\n\nYou've found one of those bridges that Trolls are so fond of living under, but there are none here.  Perhaps there will be some next week.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.66fa174294ad02d5", "{Mercenary Camp}\n\nYou've come upon a mercenary camp practicing their tactics.  \"You're too advanced for us,\" the mercenary captain says.  \"We can teach nothing more.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.68e1e92f9a9d12d5", "{Witch's Hut}\n\nYou approach the hut and observe a witch inside studying an ancient tome on %s.  As you approach, she turns and speaks.  \"You already know that which I would teach you. I can help you no further.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.6ab4a1f0b7bda188", "{Artifact}\n\nA leprechaun offers you the %s for the small price of 2500 gold and 3 %s.  Do you wish to buy this artifact?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.6b614dcca0dde223", "Upon defeating the Ghosts you sift through the debris and find something!")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.6e512f3b213f3c96", "{Magic Well}\n\nA second drink at the well in one day will not help you.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.6e67be895f4b2e0b", "{Xanadu}\n\nThe butler admits you to see the master of the house.  He trains you in the four skills a hero should know.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.6ec6a4f4693dcb8d", "{Hill Fort}\n\nAll of the %s and %s you have in your army have been trained by the battle masters of the fort.  Your army now contains %s and %s.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.6ffe5f935a4c8867", "{Hill Fort}\n\nAll of the %s you have in your army have been trained by the battle masters of the fort.  Your army now contains %s.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.74555e8e4156f4be", "{Lean To}\n\nThe lean-to is long abandoned.  There is nothing of value here.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.74e932ad068a3630", "{Shrine of the 2nd Circle}\n\nYou come across an ornate shrine attended by a group of rotund friars.  In exchange for your protection, they agree to teach you a spell - ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.785dc53c14bdbc91", "The Sphinx asks you the following riddle:\n\n'%s'\n\nYour answer?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.78bd160e3f266ea6", "{Dragon City}\n\nYou stand before the Dragon City, a place off-limits to mere humans.  Do you wish to violate this rule and challenge the Dragons to a fight?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.7e5ecd33e75d57cd", "The ogres recognize you as the Dwarfbane and lumber over to join you.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.81a2a5818237074f", "Unfortunately, you have no Magic Book to record the spell with.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.835273ee016ddfeb", "{Magic Garden}\n\nYou catch a leprechaun foolishly sleeping amidst a cluster of magic mushrooms.  In exchange for his freedom, he guides you to a small pot filled with precious things.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.8432c04b1a757522", "{Witch's Hut}\n\nYou approach the hut and observe a witch inside studying an ancient tome on %s.  As you approach, she turns and focuses her one glass eye on you.  \"You already know everything you deserve to learn!\" the witch screeches. \"NOW GET OUT OF MY HOUSE!\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.85b58cafd168a4e6", "{Artifact}\n\nYou've come across the spartan quarters of a retired soldier.  The soldier tells you that he is willing to pass on the %s to the first true leader he meets.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.85fbba93bc78c682", "Upon defeating the Skeletons you sift through the debris and find something!")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.87ca55017c24c23b", "{Artesian Spring}\n\nThe spring only refills once a week, and someone's already been here this week.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.87d5d0b84d168064", "{Tree of Knowledge}\n\nUpon your approach, the tree opens its eyes in delight.  \"It is good to see you, my student.  I hope my teachings have helped you.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.87faaee8cff00588", "The mermaids silently entice you to return later and be blessed again.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.8db49d8e3d5c5308", "As you enter the Alchemist's Tower, a hobbled, graying man in a brown cloak makes his way towards you.  He checks your pack, and sees that you have 1 cursed item.  For 750 gold, the alchemist will remove it for you.  Do you pay?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.8e7c1487402719c9", "{Shrine of the 3rd Circle}\n\nYou come across a lavish shrine attended by a group of high priests.  In exchange for your protection, they agree to teach you a sophisticated spell - ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.907f9f79f5b78059", "You speak, and nothing happens.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.90cd00d12dc7f24b", "This eye seems to be intently studying its surroundings.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.924f82c98b13def7", "{Tree of Knowledge}\n\nTears brim in the eyes of the tree.  \"I need 2000 gold.\" it whispers. (sniff)  \"Well, come back when you can pay me.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.92b0881ba080eff9", "The Demon screams its challenge and attacks!  After a short, desperate battle, you slay the monster and receive 1,000 experience points and 2,500 gold.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.95b379d46e666d70", "{Freeman's Foundry}\n\nAll of your %s have been upgraded into %s.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.95e1a0a20e2b7676", "A magical %s barrier stands tall before you, blocking your way.  Runes on the arch read, \"Speak the key and you may pass.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.95f1f95998dc4804", "{City of the Dead}\n\nYou've found the ruins of an ancient city, now inhabited solely by the undead.  Will you search?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.967de2778f210f98", "{Daemon Cave}\n\nThe entrance to the cave is dark, and a foul, sulfurous smell issues from the cave mouth.  Will you enter?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.96fabc1a4bb74b61", "{Watering Hole}\n\nThe drink at the watering hole is refreshing, but offers no further benefit.  The watering hole might help again if you fought a battle first.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.9824059f04898b92", "{Temple}\n\nIt doesn't help to pray twice before a battle.  Come back after you've fought.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.9cf24d321bfa6701", "{Ruins}\n\nYou search the ruins, but the Medusas that used to live here are gone.  Perhaps there will be more next week.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.a55956dc91df9373", "Except for evidence of a terrible battle, the cave is empty.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.aa7c539682b9fd51", "As you reach for the %s, it mysteriously disappears.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.abd64140cf81cf64", "{Standing Stones}\n\nYou've found a group of Druids worshipping at one of their strange stone edifices.  Silently, the Druids turn you away, indicating they have nothing new to teach you.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.acc859e4d069b705", "You have your crew stop up their ears with wax before the sirens' eerie song has any chance of luring them to a watery grave.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.adb07f262cb5a288", "{Witch Doctor's Hut}\n\n\"Go 'way!\", the witch doctor barks, \"you know all I know.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.af08a748652258d4", "Upon defeating the Ghosts you spend several hours sifting through the debris and find nothing.  Such a despicable act reduces your army's morale.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.b2f13c84edb58954", "Upon defeating the Skeletons you spend several hours sifting through the debris and find nothing.  Such a despicable act reduces your army's morale.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.b2fd77737182a2d9", "Unfortunately, you do not have the wisdom to understand the spell, and you are unable to learn it.  ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.b34883b51b1f43be", "Looking somewhat disappointed, the Sphinx sighs.  You've answered my riddle so here's your reward.  Now begone.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.b586887c923c2b52", "{Tree City}\n\nYou've found a Sprite Tree City.  Unfortunately, none of the Sprites living there wish to join an army.  Maybe next week.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.b748cab66a3bf25b", "  Unfortunately, you do not have the wisdom to understand the spell, and you are unable to learn it.  ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.b74e2c6dcdfc9414", "{Tree City}\n\nSome of the Sprites living in the tree city are willing to join your army for a price.  Do you want to recruit Sprites?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.b7b134ab6de2bf9c", "{Wagon}\n\nYou come across an old wagon left by a trader who didn't quite make it to safe terrain.  Searching inside, you find the '%s'.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.b84c63468364c5dd", "{Shipwreck}\n\nThe rotting hulk of a great pirate ship creaks eerily as it is pushed against the rocks.  Do you wish to search the shipwreck?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.b880ecbc34dcdb8b", "You cannot pick up this artifact, you already have a full load!")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.b957bcfea39c68b5", "The elves stand at attention as you approach.  Their leader calls to you and says, \"Let us not impede your progress, ally!  Move on, and may victory be yours.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.bc81eedbd225f1cc", "The dwarves hail you, \"Any friend of Roland is a friend of ours.  You may pass.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.bd36cf6691ab88e7", "{Flotsam}\n\nYou search through the flotsam and find some wood and some gold.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.bdc50da8baa48d7e", "  Unfortunately, you have no Magic Book to record the spell with.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.bec395b49e2bdfa9", "Shrine - Player Rankings")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.bf2299125ded4930", "You find a powerful and grotesque Demon in the cave.  \"Today,\" it rasps, \"you will fight and surely die.  But I will give you a choice of deaths.  You may fight me, or you may fight my servants.  Do you prefer to fight my servants?\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.c15ae0e09ee99d18", "\"I have a riddle for you,\" the Sphinx says.  \"Answer correctly, and you shall be rewarded.  Answer incorrectly, and you shall be eaten.  Do you accept the challenge?\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.c451cfe18d2f7330", "{Lean To}\n\nYou've found an abandoned lean-to.  Poking about, you discover some resources hidden nearby.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.c47e37b66bb1b531", "{Idol}\n\nYou've found an ancient and weathered stone idol.  Kissing it is supposed to be lucky, so you do.  The stone is very cold to the touch.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.c96f2e927c9e47ef", "{Chest}\n\nAfter spending hours trying to fish the chest out of the sea, you open it and find 1000 gold and the %s")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.c9a9da0253003e88", "{City of the Dead}\n\nSome of the surviving Liches are impressed by your victory over their fellows, and offer to join you for a price.  Do you want to recruit Liches?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.ca210d925c2d4171", "The dwarves recognize their allies and gladly join your forces.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.cb3ce775e0c55740", "Upon defeating the daemon's servants, you find a hidden cache with 2500 gold.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.cb89443bb85658f3", "{Wagon}\n\nYou come across an old wagon left by a trader who didn't quite make it to safe terrain.  Inside, you find some of the wagon's cargo still intact.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.ce98145109683d0e", "{Tree of Knowledge}\n\nUpon your approach, the tree opens its eyes in delight.  \"Ahh, an adventurer! I will be happy to teach you a little of what I have learned over the ages for a mere 2000 gold.\"  (Just bury it around my roots.)")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.cf9fdd5bf3abd972", "The ogres give you a grunt of recognition, \"Archibald's allies may pass.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.cfee7ef6dc2dfe29", "{Xanadu}\n\nThe butler opens the door and looks you up and down.  \"You are neither famous nor diplomatic enough to be admitted to see my master,\" he sniffs.  \"Come back when you think yourself worthy.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.d0681d4d11aa03cd", "{Witch Doctor's Hut}\n\nAn Orcish witch doctor living in the hut deepens your knowledge of magic by showing you how to cast stones, read portents, and decipher the intricacies of chicken entrails.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.d19251bcd8000e2e", "{Flotsam}\n\nYou search through the flotsam, and find some wood and some gold.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.d211349fcd9060a7", "An eerie wailing song emanates from the sirens perched upon the rocks.  Many of your crew fall under its spell, and dive into the water where they drown.  You are now wiser for the visit, and gain %d experience.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.d2a7adee0f4b9a8a", "{Chest}\n\nAfter spending hours trying to fish the chest out of the sea, you open it, only to find it empty.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.d2d604b822f6a317", "Insulted by your refusal of his generous offer, the leprechaun stamps his foot and ignores you.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.d4b1f646aae1de64", "{Dragon City}\n\nThe Dragon city is willing to offer some Dragons for your army for a price.  Do you wish to recruit Dragons?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.d57cce3fb667b859", "You beat the Ghosts and are able to restore the mine to production.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.d5ae03d7c7901a43", "{Artifact}\n\nA leprechaun offers you the %s for the small price of 3000 gold and 5 %s.  Do you wish to buy this artifact?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.d665709349b9262f", "{Watering Hole}\n\nA drink at the watering hole fills your troops with strength and lifts their spirits.  You can travel a bit further today.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.d7ee33967c36bb8b", "Game canceled.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.da378498c0963c83", "{Xanadu}\n\nRecognizing you, the butler refuses to admit you.  \"The master,\" he says, \"will not see the same student twice.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.da87bc41bfb2530c", "\"You guessed incorrectly,\" the Sphinx says, smiling.  The Sphinx swipes at you with a paw, knocking you to the ground.  Another blow makes the world go black, and you know no more.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.db0baf49ee252efe", "Victorious, you take your prize, the %s")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.db769672add76670", "{Artesian Spring}\n\nA drink from the spring fills your blood with magic!  You have twice your normal spell points in reserve.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.dd448d43b4794460", "The jailer tells you that the hero who was imprisoned here has been released by the king who imprisoned him.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.ddc9cf3652f5dd02", "All %d of the %s will join your army for the sum of %d gold.  Do you accept?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.dfaca12192a50638", "{Hill Fort}\n\nAn unusual alliance of Orcs, Ogres, and Dwarves offer to train (upgrade) any such troops brought to them.  Unfortunately, you have none with you.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.e5ffff5a51e4796f", "{Tree of Knowledge}\n\nAhh, an adventurer! I will be happy to teach you a little of what I have learned over the ages for a mere 10 gems.\"  (Just bury it around my roots.)")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.e7075cc43429178b", "{Freeman's Foundry}\n\nA blacksmith working at the foundry offers to convert all Pikemen and Swordsmen's weapons brought to him from iron to steel. He also says that he knows a process that will convert Iron Golems into Steel Golems.  Unfortunately, you have none of these troops in your army, so he can't help you.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.e7cd159b9a0d9237", "{Troll Bridge}\n\nTrolls living under the bridge challenge you.  Will you fight them?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.e81b091ba4b1417f", "{Magellan's Maps}\n\nThe captain sighs.  \"You don't have enough money, eh?  You can't expect me to give my maps away for free!\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.ea1d54ae68a8c04a", "The Demon screams its challenge and attacks!  After a short, desperate battle, you slay the monster and find the %s in the back of the cave.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.ead7ae60b21cca0c", "{Troll Bridge}\n\nA few Trolls remain, cowering under the bridge.  They approach you and offer to join your forces as mercenaries.  Do you want to buy any Trolls?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.eb595f1324302ad8", "You try to pay the leprechaun, but realize that you can't afford it.  The leprechaun stamps his foot and ignores you.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.ee1576513fcb95bc", "{Tree of Knowledge}\n\nTears brim in the eyes of the tree.  \"I need 10 gems.\" it whispers. (sniff)  \"Well, come back when you can pay me.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.ee47b77e069dbc64", "{Artesian Spring}\n\nA drink at the spring is supposed to give you twice your normal spell points, but you are already at that level.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.ee7fce7250a9d986", "As the sirens sing their eerie song, your small, determined army manages to overcome the urge to dive headlong into the sea.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.f0128914e00d4e7f", "The dragons, snarling and growling, agree to join forces with you, their 'Ally'.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.f275576ff90522c2", "You come upon the pyramid of a great and ancient king.  You are tempted to search it for treasure, but all the old stories warn of fearful curses and undead guardians.  Will you search?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.f28640c80e1c5d9c", "{Chest}\n\nAfter scouring the area, you fall upon a hidden treasure cache.  You may take the gold or distribute the gold to the peasants for experience.  Do you wish to keep the gold?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.f68d63dd41307454", "The dragons see you and call out.  \"Our alliance with Archibald compels us to join you.  Unfortunately you have no room.  A pity!\"  They quickly scatter.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.f87a6ac73c24c595", "The %s, awed by the power of your forces, begin to scatter.  Do you wish to pursue and engage them?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.fa57992068d990d5", "{Magic Well}\n\nA drink at the well is supposed to restore your spell points, but you are already at maximum.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.fae6f0b9369f8351", "The magical, soothing beauty of the Mermaids reaches you and your crew.  Just for a moment, you forget your worries and bask in the beauty of the moment.  The mermaids charms bless you with increased luck for your next combat.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.fafa7917b1fb1445", "{Flotsam}\n\nYou search through the flotsam, but find nothing.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.fd6fbeb8bebaabb7", "{Troll Bridge}\n\nSome Trolls living under a bridge are willing to join your army, but for a price.  Do you want to recruit Trolls?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.fd826cb8b8a55aeb", "You enter a rickety hut and talk to the magician who lives there.  He tells you of places near and far which may aid you in your journeys.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("event.inline.fff2b25d391ab29d", "{Observation Tower}\n\nFrom the observation tower, you are able to see distant lands.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("formation.grouped.help", "{Grouped Formation}\n\n'Grouped' combat formation bunches your army together in the center of your side of the battlefield.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("formation.spread.help", "{Spread Formation}\n\n'Spread' combat formation spreads your armies from the top to the bottom of the battlefield, with at least one empty space between each army.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("game.cheats_in_use", "Cheat codes are in use!\n")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("game.confirm.load", "Are you sure you want to load a new game?  (Your current game will be lost)")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("help.experience", "{Experience}\n\nExperience allows your heroes to go up levels, increasing their primary and secondary skills.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("help.resources", "{Resources}\n\nThere are seven resources in Heroes 2, used to build and improves castles, purchase troops and recruit heroes.  Gold is the most common, required for virtually everything.  Wood and ore are used for most buildings.  Gems, Mercury, Sulfur and Crystal are rare magical resources used for the most powerful creatures and buildings.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("hero.army.split.between_heroes", "Move how many %s troops from %s to %s?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("hero.army.split.prompt", "Move how many troops?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("hero.artifact.anduran_combined", "The three Anduran artifacts magically combine into one.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("hero.captain", "Captain")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("hero.confirm.dismiss", "Are you sure you want to dismiss this Hero?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("hero.level.choose_skill", "\n\nYou may learn either %s %s or %s %s.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("hero.level.help", "{Level %d}\n\nCurrent experience %d\nNext level %d")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("hero.level.learned_skill", "\n\nYou have learned %s %s.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("hero.meeting.title", "%s meets %s")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("hero.skill.necromancy.help", "{%s Necromancy (+%d)}\n\n%s Necromancy (+%d) allows %d percent of the creatures killed in combat to be brought back from the dead as Skeletons.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("hero.spell_points.help", "{Spell Points}\n\n%s currently has %d spell points out of a maximum of %d.  The maximum number of spell points is 10 times your knowledge.  It is occasionally possible to have more than your maximum spell points via special events.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("hero.summary.buka", "%s is a level %d %s with %d artifacts.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("high_score.cheater_rating", "Cheater!!!")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("high_score.cheater_suffix", "\n(Cheater)")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("high_score.congratulations.campaign", "Congratulations!\n\nDays: %d\n\nRating:\n%s\n")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("high_score.congratulations.standard", "Congratulations!\n\nDays: %d\nBase Score: %d\nDifficulty: %d\n\nScore: %d\n\nRating:\n%s\n")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("high_score.name_prompt", "Please enter your name for the high score list.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("loss.hero", "You have lost the hero %s.  Your quest is over.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("loss.time_expired", "You have failed to complete your quest in time.  All is lost.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("loss.town_fallen", "%s has fallen!  All is lost.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("map.default.chaos", "Chaos")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.attack.owner.buka", "%s's %s is under attack!")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.data.receiving", "Receiving Data")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.data.sending", "Sending Data")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.data.waiting_to_receive", "Waiting to receive game data.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.directplay.guests_ready.buka", "You have %d guest(s) now logged in.  Click 'OK' to move on, or wait for additional guests.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.directplay.load_failed", "Can't load 'DPLAYX.DLL'")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.host.canceled_game", "The host has canceled the game.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.hotseat.enter_names_prompt", "Do you wish to enter each player's name?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.hotseat.player_name_prompt", "Enter player %d's name.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.incoming_data.must_exit", "[ Incoming data, must exit... ]")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.initialization_failed", "Network initialization failed")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.load.expansion_unavailable", "At least one player does not have the Heroes II Expansion set.  You will only be able to choose from original Heroes II games.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.modem.dialing.prefix", "Dialing...")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.modem.direct_wait", "Waiting for other computer to log in to direct connection.\n\nPress 'CANCEL' to abort.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.modem.establishing", "Establishing connection...")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.modem.initialization_prompt", "Please enter any special initialization string required by your modem, or hit 'ENTER' to accept the default.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.modem.initializing", "Initializing modem...")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.modem.telephone_prompt", "Please enter the telephone number.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.modem.waiting_for_ring", "Waiting for ring...")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.netbios.initializing", "Initializing network.\n\n  Press 'CANCEL' to abort.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.netbios.not_loaded", "NETBIOS is not loaded.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.netbios.waiting_host", "Waiting On Host.\n\n  Press 'CANCEL' to abort.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.player.handle_prompt", "Please enter a 'handle' by which you will be known.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.player_exit.continue_alone.buka", "The current game has been saved as 'PLYREXIT'. Do you wish to keep playing with the computer filling in for the other humans?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.player_exit.exiting_confirm.buka", "%s is exiting the game.  The current game has been saved as 'PLYREXIT'.  Do you wish to continue playing with a computer player filling in for %s?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.player_exit.host_reports_exit", "Host player %s reports that player %s has exited the game.  The game will continue with a computer player filling in for %s.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.player_exit.host_reports_timeout", "Host player %s reports that player %s has been timed out of the game.  The game will continue with a computer player filling in for %s.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.player_exit.host_terminated.buka", "%s left the game, and the %s decided to terminate the entire game.  The game has been saved as 'PLYREXIT'.  Do you wish to play on alone with the computer taking over for all human players?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.player_exit.timed_out_confirm.buka", "%s has been timed out of the game.  The current game has been saved as 'PLYREXIT'.  Do you wish to continue playing with a computer player filling in for %s?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.receive.retry", "Error receiving data.  Keep trying?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.remote.connection_broken", "Your remote connection to the other players appears to be broken.  Do you wish to keep waiting for a response?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.remote.player_not_responding", "%s's computer is not responding.  Do you wish to keep waiting for a response?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.send.retry", "Error sending data.  Keep trying??")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.tcp.command_line_incomplete", "Incomplete TCP/IP command line information")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.tcp.fullscreen_warning", "About to initiate TCP/IP connection.  Heroes II will now drop from full screen mode to windowed mode, so that any operating-system dialog boxes can be seen.\n\nWhen the connection is successfully made, you can return to full screen mode by pressing 'F4'.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.tcp.host.guest_progress.buka", "Hosting game at %s.\n\nYou have %d guest(s) out of an expected total of %d guest(s) now logged in.  Click 'CANCEL' to move on without waiting for additional guests.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.tcp.host.guests_ready.buka", "Hosting game at %s.\n\nYou have %d guest(s) now logged in.  Click 'OK' to move on, or wait for additional guests.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("network.tcp.host.not_responding", "The host is not responding.  Keep waiting?")
