HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.0", "{Alchemist}\n\nYou have taken control of the local Alchemist shop. It will provide you with one unit of Mercury per day.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.1", "{Signpost}\n\nA signpost reads:}\n\n%s is near.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.12", "{Faerie Ring}\n\nYou enter the faerie ring, but nothing happens.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.13", "{Faerie Ring}\n\nUpon entering the mystical faerie ring, your army gains luck for its next battle.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.14", "{Campfire}\n\nRansacking an enemy camp, you discover a hidden cache of treasures.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.15", "{Fountain}\n\nYou drink from the enchanted fountain, but nothing happens.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.16", "{Fountain}\n\nAs you drink the sweet water, you gain luck for your next battle.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.17", "{Gazebo}\n\nAn old Knight appears on the steps of the gazebo. \"I am sorry, my liege, I have taught you all I can.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.18", "{Gazebo}\n\nAn old Knight appears on the steps of the gazebo. \"My liege, I will teach you all that I know to aid you in your travels.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.19", "{Genie Lamp}\n\nYou stumble upon a dented and tarnished lamp lodged deep in the earth. Do you wish to rub the lamp?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.2", "{Buoy}\n\nYour men spot a navigational buoy, confirming that you are on course.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.20", "{Graveyard}\n\nYou tentatively approach the burial ground of ancient warriors.  Do you want to search the graves?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.21", "Upon defeating the Zombies you spend several hours searching the graves and find nothing.  Such a despicable act reduces your army's morale.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.22", "Upon defeating the zomies you search the graves and find something!")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.23", "{Archer's House}\n\nA group of Archers with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.24", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.25", "{Archer's House}\n\nAs you approach the dwelling, you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.26", "{Goblin Hut}\n\nA group of Goblins with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.27", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.28", "{Goblin Hut}\n\nAs you approach the dwelling, you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.29", "{Peasant Hut}\n\nA group of Peasants with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.3", "{Buoy}\n\nYour men spot a navigational buoy, confirming that you are on course and increasing their morale.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.30", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.31", "{Peasant Hut}\n\nAs you approach the dwelling, you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.32", "{Dwarf Cottage}\n\nA group of Dwarves with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.33", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.34", "{Dwarf Cottage}\n\nAs you approach the dwelling, you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.35", "{Thatched Hut}\n\nA group of Peasants with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.36", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.37", "{Thatched Hut}\n\nAs you approach the Peasant dwelling you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.38", "{Tree House}\n\nA group of Sprites with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.39", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.40", "{Tree House}\n\nAs you approach the Sprites' tree house you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.41", "{Halfling Hole}\n\nA group of Halflings with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.42", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.43", "{Halfling Hole}\n\nAs you approach the habitat you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.44", "{Watch Tower}\n\nA group of Orcs with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.45", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.46", "{Watch Tower}\n\nAs you approach the Orcs' watch tower you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.47", "{Snow Cave}\n\nA group of Centaurs with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.48", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.49", "{Cave}\n\nAs you approach the Centaurs' cave you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.50", "{Excavation}\n\nA group of Skeletons with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.51", "You are unable to recruit at this time, your ranks are full.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.52", "{Excavation}\n\nAs you approach the Skeletons' excavation you notice that there is no one here.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.58", "{Lighthouse}\n\nThe lighthouse is now under your control, and all of your ships will now move further each turn.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.59", "{Water Wheel}\n\nThe keeper of the mill announces: \"Milord, I am sorry, there is no gold currently available.  Please try again next week.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.60", "{Water Wheel}\n\nThe keeper of the mill announces: \"Milord, I have been working very hard to provide you with this gold, come back next week for more.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.61", "{Ore Mine}\n\nYou gain control of an ore mine. It will provide you with two units of ore per day.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.62", "{Sulfur Mine}\n\nYou gain control of a sulfur mine. It will provide you with one unit of sulfur per day.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.63", "{Crystal Mine}\n\nYou gain control of a crystal mine. It will provide you with one unit of crystal per day.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.64", "{Gem Mine}\n\nYou gain control of a gem mine. It will provide you with one unit of gems per day.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.65", "{Gold Mine}\n\nYou gain control of a gold mine. It will provide you with 1000 gold per day.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.66", "{Followers}\n\nA group of %s with a desire for greater glory wish to join you. Do you accept? ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.67", "Insulted by your refusal of their offer, the monsters attack!")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.68", "{Obelisk}\n\nYou come upon an obelisk made from a type of stone you have never seen before.  Staring at it intensely, the smooth surface suddenly changes to an inscription.  The inscription is a piece of a lost ancient map.  Quickly you copy down the piece and the inscription vanishes as abruptly as it had appeared.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.69", "{Obelisk}\n\nYou have already been to this obelisk.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.72", "You find a small quantity of %s.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.73", "{Sawmill}\n\nYou gain control of a sawmill. It will provide you with two units of wood per day.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.74", "{Oracle}\n\nNestled among the trees sits a blind seer. After explaining the intent of your journey, the seer activates his crystal ball, allowing you to see the strengths and weaknesses of your opponents.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.81", "{Desert Tent}\n\nA group of tattered tents, billowing in the sandy wind, beckons you.  The tents are unoccupied.  Perhaps more Nomads will be here later.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.82", "{Desert Tent}\n\nA group of tattered tents, billowing in the sandy wind, beckons you.  Do you wish to have any Nomads join you during your travels?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.83", "{Wagon}\n\nA colorful Rogues' wagon stands empty here.  Perhaps more Rogues will be here later.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.84", "{Wagon}\n\nDistant sounds of music and laughter draw you to a colorful wagon housing Rogues.  Do you wish to have any Rogues join your army?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.85", "{Whirlpool}\n\nA whirlpool engulfs your ship.  Some of your army has fallen overboard.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.86", "{Windmill}\n\nThe keeper of the mill announces: \"Milord, I am sorry, there are no resources currently available. Please try again next week.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.87", "{Windmill}\n\nThe keeper of the mill announces: \"Milord, I have been working very hard to provide you with these resources, come back next week for more.\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.93", "{Skeleton}\n\nYou come upon the remains of an unfortunate adventurer.  Searching through the tattered clothing, you find nothing.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gEventText.94", "{Skeleton}\n\nYou come upon the remains of an unfortunate adventurer.  Searching through the tattered clothing, you find ")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.0", "{Small Maps}\n\nView only maps of size small (36 x 36).")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.1", "{Medium Maps}\n\nView only maps of size medium (72 x 72).")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.10", "{Victory Condition Icon}\n\nThere are 6 possibilities:\n\n{Tombstone} - Defeat all enemy heroes and towns.\n\n{Town} - Capture a specific town.\n\n{Hero Face} - Defeat a specific hero.\n\n{Medal} - Find a specific artifact.\n\n{Handshake} - Your side defeats the opposing side.\n\n{Coins} - Accumulate a large amount of gold.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.11", "{Loss Condition Icon}\n\nThere are 4 possible loss conditions, as indicated by the following icons:\n\n{Tombstone} - Lose all your heroes and towns.\n\n{Town} - Lose a specific town.\n\n{Hero Face} - Lose a specific hero.\n\n{Hourglass} - Run out of time. (Fail to win by a certain point.)")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.12", "{Selected Name}\n\nThe name of the currently selected map.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.13", "{Selected Description}\n\nThe description of the currently selected map.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.14", "{Selected Map Difficulty}\n\nThe map difficulty of the currently selected map.  The map difficulty is determined by the scenario designer.  More difficult maps might include more or stronger enemies, fewer resources, or other special conditions making things tougher for the human player.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.2", "{Large Maps}\n\nView only maps of size large (108 x 108).")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.3", "{Extra Large Maps}\n\nView only maps of size extra large (144 x 144).")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.4", "{All Maps}\n\nView all maps, regardless of size.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.5", "{Enter Name}\n\nEnter the name of the file you wish to save.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.6", "{OK}\n\nAccept the choice made.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.7", "{Cancel}\n\nCancel without making a choice.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.8", "{Size Icon}\n\nIndicates whether the map is small (36 x 36), medium (72 x 72), large (108 x 108), or extra large (144 x 144).")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.gFileRequestHelp.9", "{Players Icon}\n\nIndicates how many players total are in the scenario.  Any positions not occupied by humans will be occupied by computer players.")
