HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitBuy.0", "Restless spirits of long dead warriors seeking their final resting place offer to join you in hopes of finding peace.  Do you wish to recruit ghosts?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitBuy.1", "As you approach the bubbling pit of mud, creatures begin to climb out and position themselves around it.  In unison they say: \"Mother Earth would like to offer you a few of her troops.  Do you want to recruit Earth Elementals?\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitBuy.2", "White stone pillars support a roof that rises up to the sky.  As you enter the structure, the dead air of the outside gives way to a whirling gust that almost pushes you back out.  The air current materializes into a barely visible form.  The creature asks, in what can only be described as a loud whisper: \"Why have you come?  Are you here to call upon the forces of the air?\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitBuy.3", "Beneath a structure that serves to hold in heat, Fire Elementals move about in a fiery pool of molten lava.  A group of them approach you and offer their services.  Would you like to recruit Fire Elementals?")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitBuy.4", "Crystalline structures cast shadows over a small reflective pool of water.  You peer into the pool, and a face that is not your own peers back.  It asks: \"Would you like to call upon the powers of water?\"")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitEmpty.0", "This burial site is deathly still.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitEmpty.1", "The pit of mud bubbles for a minute and then lies still.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitEmpty.2", "You enter the structure of white stone pillars, and find nothing.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitEmpty.3", "No Fire Elementals approach you from the lava pool.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitEmpty.4", "A face forms in the water for a moment, and then is gone.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitmentSiteNames.0", "Barrow Mounds")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitmentSiteNames.1", "Earth Summoning Altar")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitmentSiteNames.2", "Air Summoning Altar")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitmentSiteNames.3", "Fire Summoning Altar")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xRecruitmentSiteNames.4", "Water Summoning Altar")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.0.0", "Subdue the unruly local lords in order to provide the Empire with facilities to operate in this region.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.0.1", "Eliminate all oposition in this area. Then the first piece of the artifact will be yours.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.0.2", "The sorceresses to the northeast are rebelling! For the good of the empire you must quash their feeble uprising on your way to the mountains.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.0.3", "Having prepared for your arrival, Kraeger has arranged for a force of necromancers to thwart your quest. You must capture the castle of Scabsdale before the first day of the third week, or the Necromancers will be too strong for you.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.0.4", "The barbarian despot in this area is, as yet, ignorant of your presence. Quickly, build up your forces before you are discovered and attacked! Secure the region by subduing all enemy forces.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.0.5", "The Empire is weak in this region. You will be unable to completely subdue all forces in this area, so take what you can before reprisal strikes. Remember, your true goal is to claim the Helmet of Anduran.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.0.6", "For the good of the Empire, eliminate Kraeger.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.0.7", "At last, you have the opportunity and the facilities to rid the Empire of the necromancer's evil. Eradicate them completely, and you will be sung as a hero for all time.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.1.0", "Conquer and unite all the enemy tribes. Don't lose the hero Jarkonas, the forefather of all descendants.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.1.1", "Your rival, the kingdom of Harondale, is attacking weak towns on your border! Recover from their first strike and crush them completely!")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.1.2", "Find your wayward son Joseph who is rumored to be living in the desolate lands. Do it before the first day of the third month or it will be of no help to your family.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.1.3", "Rescue your crazy uncle Ivan. Find him before the first day of the fourth month or it will be no help to your kingdom.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.1.4", "Destroy the barbarians who are attacking the southern border of your kingdom! Recover your fallen towns, and then invade the jungle kingdom. Leave no enemy standing.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.1.5", "Retake the castle of Ivory Gates, which has fallen due to treachery.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.1.6", "Gain the favor of the elves. They will not allow trees to be chopped down, so we will send you wood every 2 weeks. You must complete your mission before the first day of the seventh month, or the kingdom will surely fall.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.1.7", "This is the final battle against your rival kingdom of Harondale. Eliminate everyone, and don't lose the hero Jarkonas VI.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.2.0", "Your mission is to vanquish the warring mages in the magical Shrouded Isles. The completion of this task will give you a fighting chance against your rivals.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.2.1", "The location of the great library has been discovered! You must make your way to it, and reclaim the city of Chronos in which it lies.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.2.2", "Find the Orb of negation, which is said to be buried in this land. There are clues inscribed on stone obelisks which will help lead you to your prize. Find the Orb before the first day of the sixth month, or your rivals will surely have gotten to the fount before you.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.2.3", "You must take control of the castle of Magic, where the fount of wizardry lies. Do this and your victory will be supreme.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.3.0", "Capture the town on the island off the southeast shore in order to construct a boat and travel back towards the mainland. Do not lose the hero Gallavant.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.3.1", "Find and defeat Martine, the pirate leader, who resides in Pirates Cove. Do not lose Gallavant or your quest will be over.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.3.2", "Eliminate all the other forces who oppose the rule of Lord Alberon. Gallavant must not die.")
HOMM2_MESSAGE("table.xScenarioDescription.3.3", "Overthrow the entrenched monarchy of Lord Alberon, and claim all the land in your name. Gallavant must not die.")
